WEBVTT

00:02:57.590 --> 00:03:02.595
We write ourselves and our imaginations
out of the pleasure equation.

00:03:04.222 --> 00:03:05.890
I had this hunch that my friend,

00:03:05.932 --> 00:03:10.061
that many of us, were experiencing
a crisis of inspiration.

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:12.647
In the years after college,

00:03:12.647 --> 00:03:16.067
my fascination with the role
of imagination and sexuality only grew.

00:03:17.026 --> 00:03:22.031
Eventually, I left the career I'd built
to start a company called Dipsea,

00:03:22.031 --> 00:03:27.286
which creates stories, audio stories,
designed to turn women on.

00:03:28.621 --> 00:03:30.748
I decided to focus on audio